<title>JAPAN: JGBs end up, but off highs as Tokyo stocks tumble.</title>
<headline>JGBs end up, but off highs as Tokyo stocks tumble.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key March JGB futures ended higher but were off the day's highs on speculative selling as Tokyo share prices plunged sharply toward the close. *Cash bond buying by some investors, such as city banks and public funds seen as having triggered rise in JGBs.</p>
</text>
